{"about":["Experience Sly 2: Band of Thieves™ originally released on the PlayStation®2 console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters.","Sly and the gang are back! And they’re ready to pull off the biggest job of their lives, yet! Journey around the world and beat the Klaww Gang at their own game.","This title has been converted from the PlayStation®2 version to the PlayStation®4 and PlayStation®5 consoles and provides newly added features. Consequently, there may be times where the title plays differently from the PlayStation®2 version, or where some features may cause the title to not function properly. This version does not support the PlayStation®2 console’s peripherals, therefore some functionality may not be available."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/1b93064bad1f9db6486af4565f3f9934d3b8f4a2ac3e7049.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/1b93064bad1f9db6486af4565f3f9934d3b8f4a2ac3e7049.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/c791c824e4cef899a01be0cc6002e2408ecab1b8c837aeec.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/c791c824e4cef899a01be0cc6002e2408ecab1b8c837aeec.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/ca00bc1be2c535ff06bebf9e5b5cbd94c8bc7cbef864308a.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/ca00bc1be2c535ff06bebf9e5b5cbd94c8bc7cbef864308a.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/e32e2ced5fdb4699e87def2f0e38474647640468e06978af.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/e32e2ced5fdb4699e87def2f0e38474647640468e06978af.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202411/2223/324602e65fc43446191